@startuml
skin rose
skinparam ActivityFontSize 15
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
start
:User executes filter command;

'Since the beta syntax does not support placing the condition outside the
'diamond we place it as the true branch instead.

if () then ([input is valid])
    :Build predicate from the role and the tags;
    :Replace the active predicate
    (any earlier filter or find is discarded);
    :Show "Showing X of Y clients.";
else ([else])
    :Show error;
    stop
endif

:User executes add, edit, delete, role, note or clear confirm;
:Change the address book;
:Keep the active predicate;
:Update the displayed list
(a client who matches is shown,
a client who does not match is hidden);
stop
@enduml
